length-weighted group count and `E_e` the physical lift errors of the decision-cell outputs. -/
theorem leaf_error_patterns (S : Finset (ℤ × ℤ)) (gs : ℤ × ℤ → Finset A.Grp)
    (Zout ZU : ℤ × ℤ → Fin 4 → A.Grp → ColumnL2 (Fin ap.Mc)) {Bs M Ee : ℝ} (hBs : 0 ≤ Bs)
    (hsize : ∀ I ∈ S, ∀ G ∈ gs I, ∀ l,
      ‖π (D.core l G I (ZU I l G))‖ ≤ Bs * Real.sqrt (dyadicGridLength A.G I.1) ∧
      ‖π (D.side l G I (Zout I l G) (ZU I l G))‖ ≤ Bs * Real.sqrt (dyadicGridLength A.G I.1) ∧
      ‖π (D.err l G I (ZU I l G))‖ ≤ Bs * Real.sqrt (dyadicGridLength A.G I.1))
    (hM : ∑ I ∈ S, dyadicGridLength A.G I.1 * (gs I).card ≤ M)
    (hE : ∑ I ∈ S, ∑ G ∈ gs I, ∑ l, ∫ y in dyadicGridCell A.G I.1 I.2,
      ‖(ZU I l G : ℝ → ColumnHilbert (Fin ap.Mc)) y none -
        ((D.Ms l G).L.op (ZU I l G) : ℝ → ColumnHilbert (D.Ms l G).Md) y none‖ ^ 2 ≤ Ee) :
    ∑ I ∈ S, dyadicGridLength A.G I.1 * ∑ σ ∈ Finset.univ.filter (fun σ => ∃ l, σ l = 2),
        ‖D.patF (gs I) I (Zout I) (ZU I) σ‖ ≤
